<title>DENMARK: Deutsche Finance adds half-bln DKK to bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Finance adds half-bln DKK to bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Deutsche Finance N.V. said on Tuesday it was increasing its four percent bond issue of October 25, due 2002, by 500 million crowns to a total of one billion crowns.</p>
<p>Lead manager Sparekassen Nordjylland said in a statement that other aspects of the offer were unchanged. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
